# AirFryerSmart — redirect rules (Cloudflare Pages + Netlify)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. ACTIVE: the site was first uploaded inside a wrapper folder, so a stale
#    duplicate copy is still reachable at /airfryersmart-project/... Permanent
#    redirects keep that copy out of Google's index and off your crawl budget.
#    Safe to keep forever, even if you later delete the folder from the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/airfryersmart-project/*  /:splat  301
/airfryersmart-project    /       301

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. OPTIONAL: after you buy a custom domain, add it in Cloudflare Pages,
#    change SITE_URL in assets/js/config.js, re-run `node tools/build.js`,
#    then uncomment the two lines below (replace airfryersmart.com with your
#    real domain). This carries your rankings and backlinks across.
#
# https://airfryersmart.pages.dev/*  https://airfryersmart.com/:splat  301
# https://airfryersmart.pages.dev    https://airfryersmart.com/        301
#
# Do NOT enable these while you are still on the free subdomain — it would
# redirect visitors to a domain you do not own yet.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
